  "videos": [
    {
      "id": "sun",
      "comp": "WhatIfSun",
      "title": {
        "top": "WHAT IF THE SUN SUDDENLY",
        "pill": "DISAPPEARED?"
      },
      "scenes": [
        {
          "id": "hook",
          "text": "What would happen if the Sun suddenly disappeared?"
        },
        {
          "id": "delay",
          "label": {
            "text": "8 MINUTES",
            "style": "card"
          },
          "text": "For about eight minutes, nothing at all! That's how long sunlight takes to reach us."
        },
        {
          "id": "dark",
          "label": {
            "text": "TOTAL DARKNESS",
            "style": "red"
          },
          "text": "Then, the sky would go black. Even the Moon would vanish, because moonlight is just reflected sunlight."
        },
        {
          "id": "plants",
          "label": {
            "text": "NO MORE FOOD",
            "style": "yellow"
          },
          "text": "Plants would stop making food, and slowly start to die."
        },
        {
          "id": "drift",
          "label": {
            "text": "LOST IN SPACE",
            "style": "card"
          },
          "text": "Without the Sun's pull, Earth would fly off in a straight line, into deep space."
        },
        {
          "id": "cold",
          "label": {
            "text": "DEEP FREEZE",
            "style": "yellow"
          },
          "text": "But the biggest change would be the cold. In a week, it would be colder than any winter. Within a year, the oceans would freeze over."
        },
        {
          "id": "vents",
          "label": {
            "text": "LIFE HANGS ON",
            "style": "card"
          },
          "text": "Still, deep under the ice, tiny life could survive near warm volcanic vents."
        },
        {
          "id": "outro",
          "label": {
            "text": "THANK YOU, SUN!",
            "style": "yellow"
          },
          "text": "So, thank you, Sun! Subscribe for more what-ifs."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
