        {
          "id": "storms",
          "label": {
            "text": "NO HURRICANES",
            "style": "red"
          },
          "text": "And the weather would totally change. Hurricanes couldn't form, because Earth's spin is what makes them swirl."
        },
        {
          "id": "outro",
          "label": {
            "text": "KEEP SPINNING, EARTH!",
            "style": "yellow"
          },
          "text": "So, keep spinning, Earth! Subscribe for more what-ifs."
        }
      ]
    },
